Calculate ivcErrorMessage as con($class().$name,".",$cmethod().$name,"//Java Worker Critical Error. ",pError.errorCode,": ",pError.errorInfo)

If isheadless()|sys(6)="U"
	Send to trace log (Always log) [ivcErrorMessage]
Else
	Do $ctask.$showmessage(ivcErrorMessage,"Erro",kMsgIcon)
End If
Quit method